rom":"newrizer","type":"text","text":"/start","file":null,"ts":1790581293296,"time":"07:41","replyTo":null,"reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvcaug34c1g","conversationId":"dm:botfather:newrizer","from":"BotFather","type":"text","text":"Привет, Newrizer! Я BotFather — создаю ботов для NMessenger и выдаю им API-ключи.\n\n**Команды:**\n/newbot — создать нового бота\n/setcommands — список команд бота (подсказки при вводе «/»)\n/mybots — мои боты\n/token — показать API-ключ\n/revoke — выпустить новый ключ (старый перестанет работать)\n/setname — изменить имя бота\n/setabout — изменить описание\n/setuserpic — сменить аватар (пришлите фото)\n/deletebot — удалить бота\n/cancel — отменить текущее действие","ts":1790581293318,"time":"07:41","reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvcex3qkwuu","conversationId":"dm:botfather:newrizer","from":"newrizer","type":"text","text":"/newbot","file":null,"ts":1790581293465,"time":"07:41","replyTo":null,"reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvceytztjjw","conversationId":"dm:botfather:newrizer","from":"BotFather","type":"text","text":"Отлично, создаём нового бота. Как его назовём? Пришлите имя (до 32 символов).","ts":1790581293466,"time":"07:41","reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvchpk45c5p","conversationId":"dm:botfather:newrizer","from":"newrizer","type":"text","text":"Питон бот","file":null,"ts":1790581293565,"time":"07:41","replyTo":null,"reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvchuxc5hn1","conversationId":"dm:botfather:newrizer","from":"BotFather","type":"text","text":"Хорошо. Теперь username бота — латиница, цифры и «_», 5–24 символа, обязательно оканчивается на **bot**. Например: `__bot`","ts":1790581293570,"time":"07:41","reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvck2dcj51y","conversationId":"dm:botfather:newrizer","from":"newrizer","type":"text","text":"py_bot","file":null,"ts":1790581293650,"time":"07:41","replyTo":null,"reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvcmfb6773r","conversationId":"dm:botfather:newrizer","from":"BotFather","type":"text","text":"Готово! Бот **Питон бот** создан: @py_bot\n\n**API-ключ** @py_bot — никому не показывайте:\n`nmbot:ae30c9d4a49b7f2a668fcb0c263bcd249090`\n\n**Бот на Python за минуту** (сторонние библиотеки не нужны):\n1. Скачайте {ORIGIN}/sdk/nmessenger_bot.py в папку с ботом\n2. Создайте bot.py:\n```\nfrom nmessenger_bot import Bot\n\nbot = Bot(\"nmbot:ae30c9d4a49b7f2a668fcb0c263bcd249090\", \"{ORIGIN}\")\n\n@bot.command(\"start\")\ndef start(m):\n    m.reply(\"Привет! Я работаю 🎉\")\n\n@bot.message()\ndef echo(m):\n    m.reply(\"Вы написали: \" + m.text)\n\nbot.run()\n```\n3. Запустите: `python bot.py` — и напишите боту @py_bot\nПолный пример с командами, файлами и кнопкой /help: {ORIGIN}/sdk/example_bot.py\n\n**Отправить сообщение:**\n```\ncurl -X POST {ORIGIN}/api/bot/nmbot:ae30c9d4a49b7f2a668fcb0c263bcd249090/sendMessage \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"chat_id\":\"ID_чата_или_username\",\"text\":\"Привет!\"}'\n```\n**Информация о боте:** `GET {ORIGIN}/api/bot/nmbot:ae30c9d4a49b7f2a668fcb0c263bcd249090/me`\n\nchat_id — ID чата из его информации (например group:abc123) или username пользователя. В группу или канал бота добавляют через информацию о чате → «Добавить бота».","ts":1790581293735,"time":"07:41","reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvcr4wjy3nt","conversationId":"dm:botfather:newrizer","from":"newrizer","type":"text","text":"/setcommands","file":null,"ts":1790581293904,"time":"07:41","replyTo":null,"reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvcr5l189pn","conversationId":"dm:botfather:newrizer","from":"BotFather","type":"text","text":"Пришлите список команд для @py_bot, каждая с новой строки в формате `команда - описание`:\n```\nstart - Запустить бота\nhelp - Помощь\n```\nЧтобы очистить — напишите «нет».","ts":1790581293905,"time":"07:41","reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvct4i5s7n7","conversationId":"dm:botfather:newrizer","from":"newrizer","type":"text","text":"start - Запуск\nhelp - Помощь","file":null,"ts":1790581293976,"time":"07:41","replyTo":null,"reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvct6rftbhg","conversationId":"dm:botfather:newrizer","from":"BotFather","type":"text","text":"Сохранено команд: 2. Теперь при вводе «/» в чате с @py_bot появятся подсказки.","ts":1790581293978,"time":"07:41","reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false}],"lastMessage":{"text":"Сохранено команд: 2. Теперь при вводе «/» в чате с @py_bot появятся подсказки.","ts":1790581293978,"from":"BotFather","time":"07:41"},"unread":{"botfather":6,"newrizer":1},"readAt":{"newrizer":1790581293918},"flags":{},"hidden":{},"createdAt":1790581292958,"id":"dm:botfather:newrizer","type":"dm","name":null,"participants":["newrizer","BotFather"]},"dm:alice:py_bot":{"messages":[{"id":"mukxvf56r8o9s5","conversationId":"dm:alice:py_bot","from":"alice","type":"text","text":"/start","file":null,"ts":1790581297002,"time":"07:41","replyTo":null,"reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvf5cbucoa1","conversationId":"dm:alice:py_bot","from":"py_bot","type":"text","text":"Привет, Алиса! Я на Python.","ts":1790581297007,"time":"07:41","replyTo":{"id":"mukxvf56r8o9s5","from":"alice","text":"/start","type":"text"},"reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvfefxxwvl1","conversationId":"dm:alice:py_bot","from":"alice","type":"text","text":"/time","file":null,"ts":1790581297335,"time":"07:41","replyTo":null,"reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvfemet16ib","conversationId":"dm:alice:py_bot","from":"py_bot","type":"text","text":"время: 12:00","ts":1790581297342,"time":"07:41","replyTo":null,"reactions":{},"edited":false,"deleted":false},{"id":"mukxvfhnsuu963","conversationId":"dm:alice:py_bot","from":"alice","type":"text","text":"привет бот","file":null,"ts":1790581297451,"time":"07